# Test that loop pattern survives 50,000 iterations with TCO.
# This tests the recursion-through-builtin path (if builtin returning thunk).
[loop: [fn [let n@Int] [if [= n 0] "looped" [loop [- n 1]]]]]
[loop 10000]
=== error
